# Build context is the repository root.
# Keep it small and never send local secrets or host-built artifacts into the build.

.git
.github
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local env files (Vite would bake apps/*/.env into the bundle); examples stay.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor / OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.log
